          "headline": "Alibaba releases Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B",
          "summary": "Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B is an Apache 2.0 open-weight MoE model (80B total, 3B active) using hybrid Gated DeltaNet and gated attention, in Instruct and Thinking versions. Qwen says the base model beats Qwen3-32B-Base at about 10% of the training cost with over 10x throughput at contexts above 32K.",
